# Practice Projects — {{TITLE}}

Projects integrate multiple demonstrated skills around a bounded problem. A project is proposed before it is considered active.

## Progression

1. Define the user, need, or technical question.
2. Map required skills and missing prerequisites.
3. Specify acceptance, safety, authorization, and rollback criteria.
4. Build the smallest baseline.
5. Change or extend one capability at a time.
6. Verify against the baseline.
7. Preserve failures, decisions, and evidence.
8. Conduct a final defense and retrospective.

Use [_project-template.md](_project-template.md). Do not claim a project is complete because an artifact exists; test it against its written acceptance criteria.
